From e0507422868efe74ea498ec490f3cee9e869a278 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qcom-toolbox <169756160+qcom-toolbox@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:30:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] arm64: configs: add exynos7870-gtactive2lte_defconfig

Galaxy Tab Active2 LTE (SM-T395). Based on the stock T395XXSDCUI7 kernel
config (/proc/config.gz), plus the eBPF, zram and netfilter options
Android 15+ needs, with Samsung TIMA/RKP, DEFEX, root restrictions, KNOX
and the Knox domain filter disabled.

Also adds the S-Pen and touch firmware as binaries: 3.18 builds embed
firmware from the source dir, so an O= build can't use the .ihex files.
Tested booting TWRP on a rev06 board: panel, touch, S-Pen, Mali,
SM5705 charger and fuel gauge all probe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
